What is Optical Transport Network (OTN) Equipment?
Optical Transport Network (OTN) equipment forms the backbone of high-capacity data transmission systems, enabling efficient, scalable, and reliable communication across fiber optic networks. These systems integrate advanced multiplexing, switching, and management functionalities to handle massive bandwidth demands. OTN solutions have become indispensable for telecom operators and cloud service providers dealing with the data deluge caused by streaming services, IoT devices, and enterprise digital transformation initiatives.
